{
  "$defs": {
    "DischargeScreen": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Whether the dewatering discharge is separable in the gage record (all ``[inference]``).",
      "properties": {
        "upstream_gage": {
          "title": "Upstream Gage",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "upstream_name": {
          "title": "Upstream Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "downstream_gage": {
          "title": "Downstream Gage",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "downstream_name": {
          "title": "Downstream Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "incremental_da_sqmi": {
          "title": "Incremental Da Sqmi",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "expected_discharge_cfs": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ProvenancedValue"
        },
        "window": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ReachWindow"
        },
        "baseline": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ReachWindow"
        },
        "baseflow_gain_delta_cfs": {
          "title": "Baseflow Gain Delta Cfs",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "baseflow_resid_delta_cfs": {
          "title": "Baseflow Resid Delta Cfs",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "upstream_floor_delta_cfs": {
          "title": "Upstream Floor Delta Cfs",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "separable": {
          "title": "Separable",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "outcome": {
          "enum": [
            "not_separable",
            "elevated_gain",
            "elevated_floor"
          ],
          "title": "Outcome",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "tag": {
          "default": "inference",
          "title": "Tag",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "note": {
          "title": "Note",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "caveats": {
          "default": [],
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Caveats",
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "upstream_gage",
        "upstream_name",
        "downstream_gage",
        "downstream_name",
        "incremental_da_sqmi",
        "expected_discharge_cfs",
        "window",
        "baseline",
        "baseflow_gain_delta_cfs",
        "baseflow_resid_delta_cfs",
        "upstream_floor_delta_cfs",
        "separable",
        "outcome",
        "note"
      ],
      "title": "DischargeScreen",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "HydraulicGradient": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "The regional water-table gradient near the field, fit from census head (all ``[inference]``).\n\nHead = ``dem_elev_ft - static_water_level_ft`` per shallow census well; a plane fit gives the\ndirection groundwater flows (down-gradient) + its steepness. The groundwater analog of the\nsurface-water upstream/downstream — a radial cone is direction-blind, but real flow is not.",
      "properties": {
        "flow_bearing_deg": {
          "title": "Flow Bearing Deg",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "magnitude_ft_per_mi": {
          "title": "Magnitude Ft Per Mi",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "n_wells": {
          "title": "N Wells",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "r2": {
          "title": "R2",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "note": {
          "title": "Note",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "flow_bearing_deg",
        "magnitude_ft_per_mi",
        "n_wells",
        "r2",
        "note"
      ],
      "title": "HydraulicGradient",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ImpactedWell": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "A census well inside the composite cone, with its superimposed drawdown.\n\nBeyond the drawdown MAGNITUDE, two vulnerability lenses: (1) ``goes_dry`` compares the drawdown to\nthe well's OWN available water column (``available_column_ft`` = total depth - static level) — a\nvery shallow well is dewatered by a decline a deep well shrugs off; (2) ``gradient_position`` is\nthe well's place relative to the field along the regional groundwater gradient (a down-gradient\nwell sees the field ~upstream of it in flow terms). Both ``[inference]``.",
      "properties": {
        "object_id": {
          "title": "Object Id",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "well_use": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Well Use"
        },
        "aquifer_type": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Aquifer Type"
        },
        "distance_ft": {
          "title": "Distance Ft",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "composite_drawdown_ft": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ProvenancedValue"
        },
        "available_column_ft": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Available Column Ft"
        },
        "column_consumed_frac": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Column Consumed Frac"
        },
        "goes_dry": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Goes Dry"
        },
        "gradient_position": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "down-gradient",
                "up-gradient",
                "cross-gradient"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Gradient Position"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "object_id",
        "well_use",
        "aquifer_type",
        "distance_ft",
        "composite_drawdown_ft"
      ],
      "title": "ImpactedWell",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ProvenancedValue": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "A single numeric quantity tagged with its provenance.\n\nConstruct via the classmethods (:meth:`from_document`, :meth:`from_connector`,\n:meth:`assume`, :meth:`derived`) so the ``source`` tag is never forgotten.\n\nA **measured or derived estimate** may also carry a quantitative uncertainty range\n(#760): optional absolute ``low``/``high`` bounds around the central ``value``,\n*orthogonal* to the qualitative ``confidence`` enum. The convention: a document- or\nconnector-verbatim figure is a single value (no band); an estimate whose honest\nrepresentation is \"226 ± ~35 ac\" carries ``low``/``high`` so downstream consumers\n(the bundle, the frontend, the Monte-Carlo engine #271) see the spread as data, not\nprose buried in the citation. The estimate constructors (:meth:`derived`,\n:meth:`assume`, :meth:`from_reference`) take the range inline; :meth:`with_range`\nattaches one to any value (e.g. a document-anchored central with a derived band).",
      "properties": {
        "value": {
          "title": "Value",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "unit": {
          "title": "Unit",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source": {
          "enum": [
            "document",
            "connector",
            "reference",
            "assumption",
            "derived"
          ],
          "title": "Source",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "citation": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Citation"
        },
        "confidence": {
          "default": "medium",
          "enum": [
            "high",
            "medium",
            "low"
          ],
          "title": "Confidence",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "asof": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Asof"
        },
        "low": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Low"
        },
        "high": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "High"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "value",
        "unit",
        "source"
      ],
      "title": "ProvenancedValue",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "ReachWindow": {
